Spec: First installable LinkGate trial

Purpose:
  Deliver a bounded Windows x64 and Android access trial from the already verified authenticated gateway.

Owns:
  ./version.json
  ./TRIAL-SCOPE.md
  ./build-trial.ps1
  ./LinkGate.iss
  ./Start-LinkGate.cmd
  ./Launch-LinkGate.ps1
  ./README-template.md
  ./server.json.example
  ./linkgate.service

Structure:
  ./sample: One independent SDK consumer and a deterministic local service example.

References:
  /docs/SECURITY-SPEC.md
  /windows/LinkGate.Runtime/LinkGate.Runtime.sdd
  /docs/mature-release.sdd

Must:
  Preserve original install/WAN evidence; version Windows and Android independently using version.json, with Android UI 0.3.0-preview.3 and Windows 0.3.0-preview.2.
  Package Windows Agent, owner/review tools, verified authenticated runtime, minimal sample and Android APK without private identities, server addresses or credentials.
  Install per-user, preserve existing identity/state, expose a working configuration/start entry and provide uninstall without deleting user state.
  Verify selected runtime/APK hashes and freeze final package hashes; do not silently substitute stock FRP or unsigned input versions.
  Limit verification to changed authorization tooling and one owned install/configure/transfer/stop/uninstall acceptance; reuse prior transport evidence.

Tasks:
  [x] #1 Deliver server device/service/grant owner commands with original-operation recovery.
  [x] #2 Build Windows setup and Android APK with complete runtime dependencies.
  [x] #3 Deliver minimal deployment/pairing guide and one independent application sample.
  [x] #4 Verify one complete isolated install and application transfer/cleanup path and freeze evidence.
  [x] #5 Deliver the narrowly scoped WAN heartbeat/FIN/sample-session fixes and record real deployment evidence.
